Ported components:

  * libs/nx-biome
      from swarm-cloud `libs/nx-biome` — Nx inference plugin for Biome targets.

  * libs/server-common
      from swarm-cloud `libs/server-common` — YAML/environment configuration
      loader and pino logging configuration.

  * libs/attestation
      from swarm-cloud `libs/swarm-attestation` — verifier of the
      `/.well-known/swarm-evidence` contract (certificate chain, trusted-root
      match, JWS, freshness and channel binding). See that library's README for
      the deviations from the source.

  * libs/ui
      from swarm-cloud `libs/ui` — the shadcn/ui primitives (upstream: shadcn/ui,
      MIT) and the oklch design tokens in `src/styles/globals.css`. Per-file
      headers record which files are verbatim and which deviate; the deviations
      are also summarised in that library's README.

  * apps/router-ui/src/components/app-shell.tsx
      layout pattern from swarm-cloud
      `apps/swarm-cloud-ui/src/components/app-shell.tsx` — sidebar plus
      breadcrumb header. Reimplemented rather than copied; see the file header.

  * libs/attestation-fixtures/tools/generate.ts
      from swarm-cloud `libs/swarm-attestation/src/__tests__/fixtures.ts` — the
      test PKI and bundle builders, reworked to emit deterministic, language-neutral
      conformance vectors.

A further port (the Rego evidence gate from swarm-cloud `apps/gatekeeper-proxy`)
will be recorded here as it lands.
